    "text": [
      "Zainab is a kind young girl living in Baghdad near the river. She has a lovely white cat named Mimi.",
      "One sunny afternoon, Mimi walked outside into the street and did not return. Zainab was worried and looked everywhere in the garden.",
      "She asked her friendly neighbor Omar for help. Together, they walked down the quiet street calling her name loudly.",
      "Suddenly, Zainab saw Mimi hiding under a green bench near a big tree. The sweet cat ran to her arms happily.",
      "They walked back home smiling under the warm sun. Zainab gave Mimi warm milk and felt peaceful joy."
    ],
